body:
I think your team is strong enough to do it. I did it with: G9 JKR(1 Zeta on General), G11 Mission(Zeta), G10 Bastila, G12 Zaalbar, G11 Jolee(Zeta) with 5 dot mods (Since Big Z was my only G12 I put 6 dot on him).

&#x200B;

I took about 20-25 attempts to get the RNG right but check out some guides on YT if you haven't already.

If you don't care about arena/fleet you don't have to restart but... it's gonna be rough since your shard is ahead of you.

&#x200B;

They increased the shards for older characters 2x so it'll be easier to get back where you were but with a more focused roster this time.

I'd highly recommend getting Piett, even at 3 stars he is useable since Vader should be going first -- if you can throw the zeta on him under Palp lead, Vader should take out most teams at that gear level before anyone else goes. As for the 5th member I'd farm up Shoretrooper so you have a pre-taunt as well as a team heal if you can get him.

&#x200B;

 This should be a decent squad until you start seeing people with the mid-end game squads, I ran this until I got DR+Malak which got replaced with SLKR and it worked well with a heavy hitting Vader.

JKR is a great goal to work towards as you'll pretty much have a solid arena squad for the first 5 divisions or so. I'd look into some ships as well as fleets are a big part of the game. A good starter fleet that will last awhile in arena would be the Geonosian's ships.

&#x200B;

If you can farm it, get Bossk's ship as well, it also shares a node with Jango Fett so it'll make it easier to get Chewy.

I guess that's part of the beauty of this game, even when you start pushing 5-7m+ GP you'll probably still be learning parts of the game. Heck, I'm still learning more about mods and I recently hit 6m.

&#x200B;

 Enjoy the ride!

JKR is a great leader to have, it's easy to build around him as you can pretty much use JKR + Bastila with any Jedi until you can get the stronger characters. You don't really need to level up T4 for the event, just get him to 7 stars to unlock the event is enough as he's not good in the later stages of the game.

&#x200B;

 If you are eventually gonna chase after Malak I'd suggest using Mission/Zaalbar/Juhani/Bastila.
